        'Rather than watching for one dramatic moment, it helps to get familiar with each sign individually, so you recognise it calmly rather than second-guessing yourself when it happens. Keep your hospital bag ready from around 36 weeks, and know your hospital\'s contact number, so you\'re not scrambling once things start moving.',
