        'Bring a short written list to a visit around 34 to 36 weeks, when your delivery plan is becoming clearer. Beyond the questions above, it\'s also worth asking about their newborn care setup, whether skin-to-skin contact right after birth is standard practice there, and what their policy is on rooming-in with your baby.',
