    applicability: 'Month 8 onward (birth planning)',
    canI: 'Not applicable',
    sensitivity: 'No',
    parts: [
      PregFaqPart(PregFaqSection.direct, '', [
        'An epidural is a type of anaesthesia, delivered through a thin tube in your lower back, that blocks pain signals from labour while keeping you awake and able to push. It\'s considered safe and is widely available in Indian private hospitals, though it\'s honestly still far less commonly used here than in many other countries.',
      ], []),
      PregFaqPart(PregFaqSection.whyMatters, '', [
        'The gap is worth naming plainly: despite being well established and safe internationally, painless delivery remains less popular in India than in many Western countries, for a mix of reasons including cost, awareness, and hospital availability, particularly outside major private hospitals. Where it is available, the safety picture is reassuring; a properly administered epidural doesn\'t meaningfully harm the baby, and doesn\'t reliably increase the chance of needing a C-section, contrary to a common myth.',
      ], []),
      PregFaqPart(PregFaqSection.forYou, '', [
        'If you\'re interested, ask specifically whether your hospital offers it, since availability varies considerably, especially in smaller cities and government facilities. In India, it typically costs an additional 5,000 to 15,000 rupees on top of your regular delivery charges, so it\'s worth checking this with your hospital and insurance in advance rather than assuming it\'s included.',
      ], []),
      PregFaqPart(PregFaqSection.doctor, '', [
        'Ask your doctor about your specific hospital\'s epidural availability and cost during a third-trimester visit, well before labour.',
      ], []),
      PregFaqPart(PregFaqSection.perspective, '', [
        'Our honest take: an epidural is a genuinely safe, effective option worth considering if labour pain concerns you, but it\'s not universally accessible in India yet, so ask early rather than assuming it will be there when you need it.',
      ], []),
      PregFaqPart(PregFaqSection.takeaways, '', [], [
        'An epidural blocks labour pain through a tube in your lower back, keeping you awake.',
        'It\'s safe and widely available in Indian private hospitals.',
        'It\'s still less commonly used in India than in many other countries.',
