      PregFaqPart(PregFaqSection.perspective, '', [
        'This is a case where a small, well-studied assist genuinely improves the odds; nothing about needing this extra help reflects anything about you or your pregnancy.',
      ], []),
      PregFaqPart(PregFaqSection.takeaways, '', [], [
        'A muscle-relaxing medication is commonly given before External Cephalic Version (ECV).',
