        'A biophysical profile combines a Non-Stress Test (NST) with an ultrasound, checking your baby\'s movement, muscle tone, breathing motions, and the amount of amniotic fluid around them. It\'s typically done in the third trimester when there\'s a specific concern about your baby\'s wellbeing that needs a fuller picture than one test alone can give.',
