        'The ultrasound part is painless and similar to any other scan you\'ve had; the Non-Stress Test portion involves the same soft belt sensors used on their own. A reassuring overall score is a good sign; a lower score prompts your doctor to discuss next steps with you directly, which might include closer monitoring or, in some cases, considering earlier delivery.',
