        'Oligohydramnios means the fluid level around your baby is lower than expected for your stage of pregnancy, usually defined as an Amniotic Fluid Index (AFI) below 5 centimetres. It\'s a prompt for closer monitoring, and the underlying cause matters more than the finding itself.',
      ], []),
      PregFaqPart(PregFaqSection.whyMatters, '', [
