      ], []),
      PregFaqPart(PregFaqSection.forYou, '', [
        'Your doctor will likely recommend more frequent scans to track your baby\'s growth and wellbeing, alongside checking your own hydration and blood pressure. Staying well hydrated is genuinely worth doing, though it isn\'t a guaranteed fix on its own; the specific cause found will guide what happens next far more than fluid intake alone.',
