        'Your doctor will likely recommend a glucose tolerance test if you haven\'t already had one, along with more detailed scanning to check on your baby. Mild polyhydramnios often needs nothing more than closer monitoring; more significant excess fluid may need additional discussion about your specific care plan, including watching for early labour, since extra fluid can sometimes contribute to this.',
