      ], []),
      PregFaqPart(PregFaqSection.forYou, '', [
        'A follow-up scan, usually around 32 weeks, will check whether your placenta\'s position has changed; many women are cleared of the diagnosis entirely at this point. Until then, your doctor may recommend avoiding strenuous activity, sex, and long periods of standing, and will explain exactly what to watch for and when to seek help.',
