        'This isn\'t meant to alarm you; most pregnancies at this stage continue safely to term, and this information exists simply so these terms make sense if they ever come up. If you do experience signs of preterm labour, knowing that even a moderately or late preterm baby often does well, especially with good hospital care, is worth holding onto.',
